# Clio Coder session state and install artifacts.
# `.clio-coder/agents/` and `.clio-coder/verifiers.yaml` ARE committed: they are the
# project's agent recipes and its declared verification catalog. Everything else here
# is machine-produced (session state, the codewiki index, generated artifacts) or a
# copy the installer made of `integration/clio-coder/`.
/.clio-coder/state.json
/.clio-coder/codewiki.json
/.clio-coder/extensions/
/.clio-coder/skills/
/.clio-coder/artifacts/
/demo/
